25SR1ZHUnljVXBvVjFSRVRqWmtiMms1VHpSbGRsRRAB"]],"CIABIhAx59pP6rizmmyK9LjwpECj",1]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["～～～完食～～～\n「這家真的已經回訪不知道幾次了，至少十次起跳 🍜」\n\n每次來幾乎都還是會點明太子叉燒飯，尤其加芥末真的超級加分。\n明太子的鹹甜搭配芥末微嗆的香氣，再配上炙燒叉燒的油脂感，吃起來超有層次，會默默一下就完食。\n\n這次拉麵選的是松露清雞鹽味味玉。\n清雞湯底很乾淨順口，松露香氣點到為止，不會太重，兩邊味道誰都不搶誰，整碗吃完也不會覺得膩。\n\n而且還可以免費加一球麵，誠意很夠。",null,[0,34]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12521728942448216741/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVTUjFaSFVubGpWWEJ2VmpGU1JWUnFXbXRpTW1zMVZIcFNiR1JzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12521728942448216741/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVTUjFaSFVubGpWWEJ2VmpGU1JWUnFXbXRpTW1zMVZIcFNiR1JzUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/12521728942448216741/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVTUjFaSFVubGpWWEJ2VmpGU1JWUnFXbXRpTW1zMVZIcFNiR1JzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12521728942448216741/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVTUjFaSFVubGpWWEJ2VmpGU1JWUnFXbXRpTW1zMVZIcFNiR1JzUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12521728942448216741/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVTUjFaSFVubGpWWEJ2VmpGU1JWUnFXbXRpTW1zMVZIcFNiR1JzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12521728942448216741/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVTUjFaSFVubGpWWEJ2VmpGU1JWUnFXbXRpTW1zMVZIcFNiR1JzUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,7437,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25SR1ZHUnljVXBvVjFSRVRqWmtiMms1VHpSbGRsRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xb7a723850a6bcac7!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnRGVGRycUpoV1RETjZkb2k5TzRldlE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25SR1ZHUnljVXBvVjFSRVRqWmtiMms1VHpSbGRsRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlv