煮麵的師傅，該休息要好好休息，廚房裡面很熱，要多喝水，想尿尿就趕快去，不要憋尿，如廁完畢後要仔細洗手，上下班騎車注意安全👍",null,[0,69]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12521728942448216741/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFHVGxFeldUTmFSMDV4WWxoR1dFMVVTbWhXTWs1TllUQm9ObHBXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12521728942448216741/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFHVGxFeldUTmFSMDV4WWxoR1dFMVVTbWhXTWs1TllUQm9ObHBXUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/12521728942448216741/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFHVGxFeldUTmFSMDV4WWxoR1dFMVVTbWhXTWs1TllUQm9ObHBXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12521728942448216741/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFHVGxFeldUTmFSMDV4WWxoR1dFMVVTbWhXTWs1TllUQm9ObHBXUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12521728942448216741/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFHVGxFeldUTmFSMDV4WWxoR1dFMVVTbWhXTWs1TllUQm9ObHBXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12521728942448216741/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFHVGxFeldUTmFSMDV4WWxoR1dFMVVTbWhXTWs1TllUQm9ObHBXUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,2359,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21GTlEzWTNaR05xYlhGWE1USmhWMk5NYTBoNlpWRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xb7a723850a6bcac7!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmFNQ3Y3ZGNqbXFXMTJhV2NMa0h6ZVE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21GTlEzWTNaR05xYlhGWE1USmhWMk5NYTBoNlpWRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21GTlEzWTNaR05xYlhGWE1USmhWMk5NYTBoNlpWRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21GTlEzWTNaR05xYlhGWE1USmhWMk5NYTBoNlpWRRILMGR0VV9lZlJUcUgaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09tRk5RM1kzWkdOcWJYRlhNVEpoVjJOTWEwaDZaVkUSCzBkdFVfZWZSVHFIIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARx8prCoUjp7cqCzBkdFVfZWZSVHFI\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320"